Many 1950s and 1960s homes in Garston still have their first copper pipes and heating. These are near the end of their working life. Pinhole leaks, rusty pipe joints and failing hot water cylinders are common in L19 homes from this time. We do <a href="/radiators-liverpool" style="color:#c2410c;font-weight:700;">radiator replacements</a> and <a href="/power-flushing-liverpool" style="color:#c2410c;font-weight:700;">power flushing</a> for Garston heating systems clogged with sludge. We also cover burst pipes, leaks and boiler breakdowns 24/7 across all of L19.</p>
