          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Older Garston heating systems fill up with black sludge (magnetite). It causes cold radiators. It can also wear out the boiler's heat exchanger early. A power flush for up to 6 radiators is £395. It clears the sludge and helps protect a new boiler warranty.</p>
